   "source": [
    "## 1. What is the overall sales pattern over time?\n",
    "\n",
    "Total daily sales show both short-term weekly variation and broader changes over time. The centered 7-day moving average is used only to make the descriptive trend easier to see; it is not a model feature.\n",
    "\n",
    "![Daily sales and descriptive moving average](../reports/figures/eda/01_daily_sales.png)"
   ]
  },
