   "source": [
    "## 2. How do sales vary by day of week and month?\n",
    "\n",
    "Weekdays and months are ordered chronologically. The calculations use daily aggregate sales, so dates rather than individual store-family rows receive equal weight. Even so, averages can reflect changing coverage and sales levels across years.\n",
    "\n",
    "![Average daily sales by weekday](../reports/figures/eda/02_weekday_sales.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "![Average daily sales by month](../reports/figures/eda/03_monthly_sales.png)"
   ]
  },
